# Tony's Pizza Fantasy — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Never commit `.env.local`.
#
# The pages currently render with no environment configuration at all.
# DATABASE_URL is required only for migrations and integration tests.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Database
#
# Local development and tests run against Docker Postgres, never a hosted
# database (`16 §11`), so tests are offline, free, and cannot reach production.
#
#   npm run db:up        start local Postgres
#   npm run db:migrate   apply migrations
#   npm run db:down      stop and DELETE the volume
#
# In production this points at Neon. Use Neon's POOLED connection string in
# serverless environments so the pool cannot exhaust connections.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DATABASE_URL=postgres://tonys:local_dev_only@localhost:5432/tonys_dev

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sleeper — no credentials required; the API is public and read-only.
# The league ID is configuration, not a secret.
#
# This is the CURRENT season's league ID. Sleeper mints a new one each year;
# earlier seasons are reached by following `previous_league_id` backwards, so
# only the newest ID is ever configured. The chain currently reads
# 2026 -> 2025 -> 2024 and terminates there.
#
# Only `npm run sleeper:record` reads the live API. Application code and the
# test suite read the committed fixtures in `fixtures/sleeper/`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SLEEPER_LEAGUE_ID=1385016656425668608

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tony's Tuesday Slice — optional.
#
# The Slice MUST publish correctly with this unset (16 §9). The template
# renderer is the default path; the model is a second renderer the
# commissioner may choose per story. Leaving this blank is a supported
# production configuration, not a degraded one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sessions — 90-day rolling cookie signing secret. Introduced with auth.
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SESSION_SECRET=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Scheduled jobs — shared secret for the two protected cron routes
# (Sunday pre-Monday snapshot, Tuesday finalize).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CRON_SECRET=
